        "alt": "",
        "attributes": {
          "src": "7_1_1.png"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-part07-1-modules-0007",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 7,
      "source_hash": "6ef5cd68d494c9d72201619ab00178682784e4127c1fd7d1f6b2375aa2c36d19",
      "translation_status": "pending",
      "original": {
        "language": "en",
        "content": "When the execution halts at the `breakpoint` command, an interactive console window is opened. Here you can write any code just as you would in a normal Python console, and see how the code works at exactly that point in the program."
      },
      "translation": {
        "language": "vi",
        "content": ""
      },
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-part07-1-modules-0008",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 8,
      "source_hash": "1e657a06b6bd14b5983a02afffb6b0302a418787ebebeaaf885bd513c39037a0",
      "translation_status": "pending",
      "original": {
        "language": "en",
        "content": "The `breakpoint` command is especially useful when you know that some line of code causes an error, but you are not quite sure why that is. Add a breakpoint just before the problematic line of code and run your program. Now you can try out different options in the interactive console window, and figure out the correct commands to include in your program."
      },
      "translation": {
        "language": "vi",
        "content": ""
      },
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-part07-1-modules-0009",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 9,
      "source_hash": "c197edecefcffb8cbc4e0388119d234c16cc5456a78c0c46fda6b2a35b67735b",
      "translation_status": "pending",
      "original": {
        "language": "en",
        "content": "It is also possible to continue execution from where it halted. The command `continue`, or the shorthand `c`, typed into the debugging console will resume execution until the next breakpoint is reached. The following picture depicts a situation where the loop has already been executed a few times:"
      },
      "translation": {
        "language": "vi",
        "content": ""
      },
      "metadata": {}
    },
