      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 28,
      "source_hash": "d6320d130d2340323b920dfc02a3faec5753f53945e1d9afdd3c4fe59cd79117",
      "translation_status": "pending",
      "original": {
        "language": "en",
        "content": "Importing modules with the star notation can be useful when testing and in some smaller projects, but it can pose some new problems, too. We will come across these later."
